# Esmeralda, Astrologer

> Esmeralda is not a shield caster. She is a shield thief. Her passive turns enemy shields into her own HP, which means her entire viability in a match is decided in the draft lobby before you touch the keyboard. Into the wrong lineup she is a mana-starved melee mage with no hard CC. Into the right one, the enemy frontline fights at half health from minute four.

