## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Sustain Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Oracle, Dominance Ice, Holy Crystal, Immortality
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Oracle, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Inspire, Tenacity, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy EXP and jungler are both physical damage threats and the control chain is manageable.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against burst mages who can remove your shield before you complete a second Frostmoon Shield cycle.; Radiant Armor over Immortality when Use against repeated magic damage that stacks up across long front-to-back fights.; Glowing Wand over Dominance Ice when Use when your team still needs anti-heal and you cannot safely stay in Dominance Ice range. Both items carry Lifebane and it does not stack, so this moves the cut onto whatever Stardust is burning.
- Total cost: 11760 gold

Default EXP setup that turns cooldown, shield amplification, and anti-sustain into a stable front line for ranked drafts.

### EXP Damage Bruiser (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings, Oracle
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Divine Glaive over Blood Wings when Use only when the enemy front line is stacking Magic Defense and you need penetration more than a regenerating shield.; Ice Queen Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team needs sticking power against mobile backliners more than raw Magic Power.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use against dive comps where you must survive the first collapse after committing Falling Starmoon.; Dominance Ice over Blood Wings when Use when a lifesteal marksman or sustain fighter is winning fights through regen instead of burst.
- Total cost: 11950 gold

Damage-leaning EXP build for games where another tank can start fights and Esmeralda is allowed to threaten carries after the first rotation.

### Jungle Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Feather of Heaven, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings, Winter Crown
- Core: Feather of Heaven, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Oracle over Winter Crown when Use when fights are extended and shield amplification matters more than a one-time active stasis.; Immortality over Winter Crown when Use when late-game objective fights are decided by whether you can rejoin after the first pick attempt.; Genius Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team has another magic damage core and repeated skill hits can shred Magic Defense for both of you.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use against HP-stacking sustain cores where burn and Lifebane provide more objective-fight value than raw burst.
- Total cost: 11960 gold

Jungle variant for tempo drafts that want Esmeralda farming into skirmishes instead of anchoring EXP lane.

